  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_Berserker.png\" title=\"Ice Berserker\"><img alt=\"Ice Berserker\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" src=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_Berserker.png\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_Berserker.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Berserker</div></div></div>\n<p>Whisker Berserkers are giant heavily armored <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whiskers\" title=\"Category:Whiskers\">Whiskers</a>.\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>They can do a lot of damage, and be difficult to deal with. Try to take them out first with your best skills.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Ice Berserker\n</td><td> Ice\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Poison Berserker\n</td><td> Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Squeakeasy_Bookkeeper\" title=\"Squeakeasy Bookkeeper\">Squeakeasy Bookkeeper</a> is a Poison Whisker Berserker found in the Squeakeasies in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Archimeates\" title=\"Archimeates\">Archimeates</a> is a Poison Whisker Berserker hero found on Level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
